---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <main class="pt-20">
    <div class="frosted-glass p-8 mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About IChO</h1>
      <p class="mb-4">Welcome to IChO, the most detailed and engaging chemistry review platform for the International Chemistry Olympiad.</p>
      <p class="mb-4">This platform is designed to help you master the concepts and practice problems that will prepare you for the IChO.</p>
      <p class="mb-4">Lowkey this is kinda easy so... let's dive in!</p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">How to Use IChO</h2>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Start with the <a href="/icho-rev/roadmap" class="text-primary">Roadmap</a> to see what topics are covered.</li>
          <li>Go through each unit and lesson at your own pace.</li>
          <li>Practice problems to test your understanding.</li>
          <li>Use the toolbox for periodic tables, constants, and calculators.</li>
          <li>Track your progress and see how far you've come!</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
